  "question": "In a regular hexagon and a regular octagon, analyze the vector decompositions of diagonal vectors. Propose a method to express the diagonal vector from the first vertex to the opposite vertex as a linear combination of adjacent side vectors. Justify your method by discussing how the symmetry of each polygon influences the coefficients in the decomposition and evaluate its effectiveness compared to other possible methods.",
