['{
  "question": "A ball is thrown horizontally from the top of a 20-meter-high building with an initial speed of 15 m/s. Another ball is thrown from the same height with an initial speed of 25 m/s. Compare the time it takes for each ball to hit the ground and explain how their horizontal distances differ.",
